WEBVTT

00:03:56.655 --> 00:04:00.379
so don't just transfer old habits
and old company culture

00:04:00.403 --> 00:04:01.618
to remote work.

00:04:01.642 --> 00:04:03.321
Build something better.

00:04:03.345 --> 00:04:04.656
To get started,

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:08.227
ask the introverts in your office
what their ideal day looks like

00:04:08.251 --> 00:04:09.660
and take your cue from there.